error[E0522]: a field named 'value' cannot have a setter
 --> $DIR/value-setter.nra:4:11
  |
3 |     export let value: int = 0;
  |                ----- the field is named 'value'
4 |         | set: value = value;
  |           ^^^ setter of the field 'value'
  |
  = note: in a setter, 'value' names the incoming value, so the field's storage would be hidden
  = help: rename the field

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0522`.
